{
  "name": "Ink device smoke",
  "description": "Real ink commit, multiply highlighter compositing, undo/redo and PencilKit Draw-and-Hold cancellation; annotated renders are saved as evidence.",
  "requires": [
    "doc.create",
    "doc.open",
    "ink.addStrokes",
    "edit.undo",
    "edit.redo",
    "query.find",
    "recognize.pageText",
    "render.page",
    "library.trash"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "command": "doc.create",
      "params": {
        "kind": "notebook",
        "title": "Ink smoke ${run}",
        "id": "SMKINK${run}",
        "cover": false,
        "pages": 1
      },
      "name": "Create disposable smoke notebook",
      "expect": {
        "json": {
          "ref": {
            "$match": "^doc:"
          },
          "pages": {
            "$len": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "save": {
        "doc": "ref",
        "page": "pages[0]",
        "pages": "pages"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "doc.open",
      "params": {
        "doc": "${doc}"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "ink.addStrokes",
      "params": {
        "page": "${page}",
        "strokes": [
          {
            "style": {
              "tool": "pen",
              "pen": "ball",
              "color": "#14213D",
              "width": 2
            },
            "fmt": "xy",
            "pts": [
              72,
              120,
              280,
              120
            ]
          },
          {
            "style": {
              "tool": "highlighter",
              "color": "#FFFF0080",
              "width": 24
            },
            "fmt": "xy",
            "pts": [
              72,
              120,
              280,
              120
            ]
          },
          {
            "style": {
              "tool": "highlighter",
              "color": "#FF880080",
              "width": 24
            },
            "fmt": "xy",
            "pts": [
              170,
              70,
              170,
              190
            ]
          }
        ],
        "ids": [
          "BASE${run}",
          "YELLOW${run}",
          "ORANGE${run}"
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "json": {
          "refs": {
            "$len": 3
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "nib_find",
      "args": {
        "in": "${page}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "json": {
          "items": {
            "$len": 3
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "nib_render",
      "args": {
        "page": "${page}",
        "marks": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "image": true,
        "json": {
          "marks": {
            "$len": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "saveImage": "ink-multiply.png"
    },
    {
      "manual": "Inspect the saved render and live canvas: yellow and orange highlighter cross over a dark pen line. Is the pen readable through both, with a darker multiply intersection instead of an opaque patch? Does the live canvas match the render?"
    },
    {
      "command": "edit.undo",
      "params": {
        "doc": "${doc}"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "nib_find",
      "args": {
        "in": "${page}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "json": {
          "items": {
            "$len": 0
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "edit.redo",
      "params": {
        "doc": "${doc}"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "nib_find",
      "args": {
        "in": "${page}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "json": {
          "items": {
            "$len": 3
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "manual": "Select Pen and enable Draw-and-Hold. Draw and hold a line and a circle until each snaps; release, undo once and redo once. Is there exactly one final shape per gesture with no duplicate raw PencilKit stroke or wet-ink ghost? Repeat a hold then interrupt by scrolling/tool switching; the next normal stroke must still commit."
    },
    {
      "manual": "On a clear area write Nib smoke with Pencil and wait for handwriting recognition. Verify the next bridge call contains those words with boxes aligned to the ink."
    },
    {
      "tool": "nib_page_text",
      "args": {
        "page": "${page}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "json": {
          "blocks": {
            "$type": "array"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "nib_render",
      "args": {
        "page": "${page}",
        "marks": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "image": true
      },
      "saveImage": "ink-after-hold.png"
    }
  ],
  "cleanup": [
    {
      "command": "library.trash",
      "params": {
        "refs": [
          "${doc}"
        ]
      },
      "name": "Move disposable notebook to recoverable Trash"
    }
  ]
}
